<title>JAPAN: Japan MOF gives licences to Hyundai Sec.</title>
<headline>Japan MOF gives licences to Hyundai Sec.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of Finance (MOF) said on Friday it had granted licences to the Tokyo branch of Hyundai Securities Co allowing it to engage in the securities business in Japan.</p>
<p>Licences for dealing, broking, underwriting and selling securities have been granted to the South Korean brokerage, MOF said in a statement.</p>
<p>A Hyundai official in Tokyo said it planned to start business on August 1.</p>
</text>
